{
  "evidenceCount": 10,
  "evidenceSpans": [
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM001-1bdf47b9",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-415977d1",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM001-0001",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "为规范 DEMO-BANK 对公客户准入与内部评级管理，统一各类对公产品的客户受理标准，制定本办法。",
      "quoteHash": "1bdf47b9656951ea2437aed23d1b5ac63448b778403d4689f8b54c26b09ca525",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T00:00:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "ae7e77d22770d0ea6712827bc04a2b7f9cc1fc1378ee2c06562c70f137917c23",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM001-20260922-ae7e77d2",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM001-f370889c",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-415977d1",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM001-0002",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "本办法适用于 DEMO-BANK 各级机构办理的全部对公产品业务，包括现金管理、结算、贸易金融、跨境金融、融资与投资银行类产品。",
      "quoteHash": "f370889ce53be76267b1b89f0f5b1657e75a2ddb81676edcd97d6b8d78968088",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T00:00:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "ae7e77d22770d0ea6712827bc04a2b7f9cc1fc1378ee2c06562c70f137917c23",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM001-20260922-ae7e77d2",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM001-f3d46dce",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-415977d1",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM001-0003",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第三条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "客户准入应当遵循\"了解你的客户、统一授信、分级授权、独立核验\"原则，不得以单一维度替代综合判断。",
      "quoteHash": "f3d46dcec8557cb55cbd8e7220c3fab1bab48413ff46994a64cc5de932582de0",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T00:00:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "ae7e77d22770d0ea6712827bc04a2b7f9cc1fc1378ee2c06562c70f137917c23",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM001-20260922-ae7e77d2",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM001-40b34db6",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-415977d1",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM001-0006",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第六条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "小微企业客户按本办法及结算类产品的专项简化流程受理；集团客户须以集团口径合并计算规模与评级。",
      "quoteHash": "40b34db676f9ec679cb01fbe5fcf95022b6f1028a80811d621a88b3906ce395b",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T00:00:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "ae7e77d22770d0ea6712827bc04a2b7f9cc1fc1378ee2c06562c70f137917c23",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM001-20260922-ae7e77d2",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM001-3bf5ddc5",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-415977d1",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM001-0007",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第七条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "客户申请办理对公产品，应当同时满足下列条件：一、依法设立并存续；二、在本行开立单位银行结算账户；三、内部评级不低于本办法第八条规定的档位；四、申请日前连续十二个月无重大结算违规记录；五、不属于本行制裁或限制名单。",
      "quoteHash": "3bf5ddc5ae070842b0938b59d1580746ce006c0579f878c00ce482a92cd1ce3b",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T00:00:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "ae7e77d22770d0ea6712827bc04a2b7f9cc1fc1378ee2c06562c70f137917c23",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM001-20260922-ae7e77d2",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM001-213c41a7",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-415977d1",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM001-0008",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第八条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "内部评级档位与准入范围的对应关系为：AA 级及以上可受理全部对公产品；BB 级至 A 级可受理除投资银行类产品外的对公产品；B 级至 BB 级以下仅可受理结算类与现金管理类产品，且须按第九条审批。",
      "quoteHash": "213c41a7f999ee2c27ad2d5dfb4862bae3fc91e80d99ca2d43f7b67c0bddddae",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T00:00:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "ae7e77d22770d0ea6712827bc04a2b7f9cc1fc1378ee2c06562c70f137917c23",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM001-20260922-ae7e77d2",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM001-d3e72c76",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-415977d1",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM001-0009",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第九条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "评级低于本办法第八条要求但高于 B 级的，须经一级分行交易银行部与风险管理部双签审批，方可受理；被列入本行制裁或限制名单的，一律不得受理。",
      "quoteHash": "d3e72c7699c78beb4a08129737a0472f3fb5663cae9ebac51b8791e71e44d1ed",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T00:00:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "ae7e77d22770d0ea6712827bc04a2b7f9cc1fc1378ee2c06562c70f137917c23",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM001-20260922-ae7e77d2",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM001-9db2c373",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-415977d1",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM001-0011",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十一条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "内部评级每年至少复评一次；发生股权变更、实际控制人变更、重大诉讼或评级下调预警的，应当在三十个自然日内重新评级。",
      "quoteHash": "9db2c373bc096a32edb68340f5f5123db58c813ae6ed8079b09c628dd17044c3",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T00:00:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "ae7e77d22770d0ea6712827bc04a2b7f9cc1fc1378ee2c06562c70f137917c23",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM001-20260922-ae7e77d2",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
        "effectiveFrom": "2026-09-22",
        "effectiveTo": null
      },
      "authorityLevel": "INTERNAL_POLICY",
      "claimType": "ELIGIBILITY",
      "evidenceId": "EVS-SRCXFAM001-b176ff83",
      "extractionRunId": "RUN-20260922-415977d1",
      "fragmentId": "FRG-SRCXFAM001-0012",
      "locator": {
        "clause": "第十二条",
        "clauseVerified": false,
        "kind": "CLAUSE"
      },
      "quote": "准入核验材料包括：营业执照、公司章程或组织文件、股东与实际控制人信息、近两年经审计财务报表、纳税与结算流水。",
      "quoteHash": "b176ff833e6170161e6147851c91402a2f70ce35165198f19c6cccc57ba17b82",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-09-22T00:00:00+08:00",
      "sourceBytesHash": "ae7e77d22770d0ea6712827bc04a2b7f9cc1fc1378ee2c06562c70f137917c23",
      "sourceId": "SRC-XFAM-001",
      "sourcePath": "01_raw/_authoritative/SRC-XFAM-001.DEMO.md",
      "sourceVersionId": "SV-SRCXFAM001-20260922-ae7e77d2",
      "usage": "AUTHORITATIVE"
    },
    {
      "applicabilityScope": {
